      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Approve & Aktivasi",
      "id": "approve-activate",
      "intro": "Setelah rule selesai dibuat dan di-submit, perlu melalui proses approve & aktivasi agar bisa berjalan di production.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Submit Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Submit Scenario** di toolbar setelah selesai mengedit\n• Isi komentar submit (opsional)\n• Status berubah jadi **Draft (Submitted)** — siap di-review",
          "color": "#f97316",
          "bg": "#fff7ed",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fed7aa;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 14px;border-radius:7px;background:#f97316;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">Submit Scenario</span><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg></div><div style=\"padding:10px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff7ed;font-size:10px;color:#c2410c;\">✏️ Komentar: Siap di-review untuk production</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Approve oleh Reviewer",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• **Reviewer** melihat rule yang perlu di-approve\n• Bisa melihat detail rule: parameter, flow, konfigurasi\n• **Approve** — setuju, rule siap diaktivasi\n• **Reject** — tolak dengan alasan, rule dikembalikan ke pembuat",
          "color": "#22c55e",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bbf7d0;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;display:flex;gap:11px;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:8px 20px;border-radius:7px;background:#22c55e;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">✅ Approve</span><span style=\"padding:8px 20px;border-radius:7px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">❌ Reject</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Aktivasi Rule",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Cari rule dengan status **Approved** di Scenario Management\n• Klik **Activate** — rule mulai mendeteksi fraud\n• **Batch Activation** — pilih beberapa rule, aktifkan sekaligus\n• **Deactivate** — nonaktifkan sementara tanpa hapus konfigurasi",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;padding:14px 16px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Deteksi Transfer Besar</span><span style=\"padding:3px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f5f3ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#7c3aed;\">Approved</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:6px 16px;border-radius:7px;background:#22c55e;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">▶ Activate</span></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
